# Inbox drops

Files under `inbox/` (except `README.md`) are unprocessed course material.

1. Read `.cursor/skills/process-inbox/SKILL.md` and follow it end-to-end.
2. Do not leave originals only in `inbox/` — file them under `assets/sources/` first.
3. Ask the user for author/date/session only when they cannot be inferred.
